## 2. The Audit (Telephony & voice) — path **1A** (primary)



### Exists in Gnani docs (Agent Builder)


| Capability                               | What docs say                                                                                                                                                          |
| ---------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Outbound call API**                    | `POST /v1/agents/{botId}/trigger_call` with `phone`, `countryCode`, `name`, optional `clientReferenceId`.                                                              |
| **Silence / listen controls**            | Advanced ASR: Initial Silence Timeout, End Silence Timeout, Max Speech Duration, Background Noise Filtering. Useful for “no speech / ignore call” style fail signals.  |
| **Passphrase check (application-level)** | Agent can collect spoken phrase; transcript available via conversation stats / post-call webhook. Custom HTTP actions (on-call / post-call) can call **your** backend. |
| **Personalization**                      | Dynamic Messages / pre-call variables can inject passphrase, commitment id, etc. into greeting/prompt (your API returns them).                                         |




### Missing / gaps (1A)


| Gap                                     | Detail                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
| --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Production outbound**                 | Trigger Call docs state the endpoint is **for testing**, numbers must be **whitelisted**, and Dynamic Variables docs say **no built-in campaign manager** — production campaign enablement is **by contacting Gnani**. Scheduling “exact 6:00 AM” for arbitrary users is not self-serve in public docs. |
| **Not a sensory polygraph**             | Advanced ASR does **not** document “awake vs in bed,” gym ambient audio, or muffled-speech environment classification. You can detect silence / no answer / missing passphrase — not bed-vs-gym acoustics.                                                                                              |
| **Voice biometrics**                    | Marketing / Android SDK pages exist for Gnani biometrics products. They are **not** in the Speech API / Agent Builder docs index you linked. Treat speaker verification as **out of documented 1A scope** unless Gnani provides separate API access.                                                    |
| **Does not use Speech API VAD headers** | Agent Builder ASR ≠ `wss://api.vachana.ai/stt/v3/stream`. `x-vad-threshold` **and related headers apply only to the Speech API WebSocket (1B).**                                                                                                                                                        |




### Fallback **1B** (Speech API STT WebSocket) — exists but incomplete alone


| Exists                                                                                            | Missing                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| `WSS wss://api.vachana.ai/stt/v3/stream`, PCM frames, `x-vad-threshold`, `x-min-silence-ms`, etc. | **No telephony.** You must supply mono PCM. No documented bridge from Agent Builder call audio → this WebSocket. Using 1B for live calls requires a **telephony audio source** not provided by Pine Labs or Gnani Speech APIs alone. |


**Decision for Sancus:** Build audit on **1A**. Keep 1B only if you later get raw call audio or a non-call channel (app mic).

