### Location — companion app (ordinary device location)

Neither Pine Labs nor Gnani provides device geolocation.


| Piece                                                        | Status                                                                             |
| ------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Read phone location with OS permission                       | **Must build** in the companion client                                             |
| Store destination coordinates at commitment setup            | **Must build** (user-entered place → your stored lat/lng, however you obtain them) |
| Compare live coordinates to destination (distance threshold) | **Must build** on your backend                                                     |
| Location from the phone call itself                          | **Does not exist** in Gnani call APIs                                              |


**Minimal location design:**

1. On schedule: store destination coordinates with the commitment.
2. On audit: companion app posts current `lat`/`lng` → backend proximity check against your threshold.
3. Fail if permission denied, mock location rejected, or telemetry missing in time.

